            "text": "<p>There have been numerous research studies conducted on red light therapy, and the overall conclusion of the research is that it can be an effective treatment option for a variety of conditions.</p><h4><a href=\"https://www.healthline.com/health/red-light-therapy-psoriasis\">Psoriasis</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/29067616/\">Psoriasis – A Clinical Review</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=acne+vulgaris+AND+PHOTOBIOMODULATION&size=200\">Acne Vulgaris</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31345324/\">Skin Rejuvenation</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/21275531/\">Cellulite</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/32911717/\">Arthritis</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33919443/\">Nerve Pain and Nerve Regeneration</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=ANXIETY+OR+DEPRESSION+OR+PTSD+AND+PHOTOBIOMODULATION&size=200\">Anxiety and Depression</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/?term=%28%28FIBROMYALGIA%5BTitle%5D%29%29+AND+%28PHOTOBIOMODULATION%29&sort=relevance\">Fibromyalgia</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31345324/\">Improved skin appearance and elasticity</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/27874264/\">Improved Muscle Performance and Recovery</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/35639100/\">Tendinopathies</a></h4>"
